cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Somatic Likelihood Tiering (SLT)"
type: software
version: 2.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-07
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/kstawiski/somatic-likelihood-tiering"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kstawiski/somatic-likelihood-tiering"
abstract: >-
  Somatic Likelihood Tiering (SLT) is a deterministic, callability-aware
  post-calling triage protocol for tumor-only whole-exome variant review.
  Version 2.1.0 implements the R1 gnomAD three-state Layer 2 contract,
  annotation-only six-cell routing, PureCN posterior preflight checks, and
  CHIP safety flagging used in the revised BIB submission package.
keywords:
  - somatic variant triage
  - tumor-only sequencing
  - whole-exome sequencing
  - gnomAD
  - callability
  - clonal hematopoiesis
  - PureCN
